# Dirtmouth after the Great Door: down from the top-left gate to the street, along it to the bench,
# sit and save, then to the well at the right-hand end and down it into the Forgotten Crossroads.
walk 28.6                                      # off the ledge and down to the street (a hard landing)
wait until y le 11.45 timeout 600
wait 90                                        # the landing's lock
walk 132.3
press up                                       # sit on the bench
wait until HK_BENCH_RESTS ge 1 timeout 600
wait 120
press cross                                    # get up
wait until HK_SAVE_WRITES ge 1 timeout 900     # the bench saves
wait 90
hold right until HK_SCENE_LOADS ge 3 timeout 1500   # along the street and down the well
wait until HK_GAME_MODE == 1 timeout 1800
